<title>USA: Plymouth, Mich., won by Roney &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>Plymouth, Mich., won by Roney &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roney &amp; Co., Inc., said it won $4.995 million of Plymouth, Mich., general obligation road bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.72 percent.</p>
</text>
